  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-iframe-element\r\n\r\n> When a Document in an iframe is marked as completely loaded, the user agent must run the iframe load event steps in parallel\\.\r\n\r\nThe iframe load event steps mutate state and fire an event. They should definitely not run in parallel.\r\n\r\nMaybe this should just be changed to \"queue a task to run the iframe load event steps\"?\r\n\r\nTentatively assigning @annevk as I think he touched these last.\r\n\r\n(Spotted by @TimothyGu.)",
